<title>USA: Nytest expects to recoup $600,000.</title>
<headline>Nytest expects to recoup $600,000.</headline>
<dateline>PORT WASHINGTON, N.Y. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nytest Environmental Inc said Friday it expects to recoup about $600,000 of a reserve charged during the June 30, 1996 quarter for discontinuing operations of its NEIPA subsidiary</p>
<p>As a result, Nytest said it will be reducing its net loss for the year ending in December 31, 1996 to $3.2 million, from about $3.8 million.</p>
